window.products.push({"id":210256,"name":"Teabloom Universal Tea Infuser with Lid/Coaster – Fits Mugs, Cups, Teapots – Food Grade 304 Stainless Steel Filter – Large Capacity with Extra-Fine Me","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t4My1NKJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE LAST TEA INFUSER YOU WILL EVER NEED. Teabloom’s Universal Tea Infuser is designed to meet all your brewing needs for years to come. Large enough to prepare a full pot of tea, it easily fits standard teapots, teacups, mugs, and travel mugs. The wide, two-handled design is easy to hold and helps prevent burns. Dimensions: 5” x 3”. PREMIUM STAINLESS STEEL - THE RIGHT MATERIAL FOR THE TASK. Our Universal Tea Infuser is crafted of 18/8, food grade stainless steel – one of the most durable and sought-after materials containing zero chemicals and superior corrosion resistance. Will never crack, shatter, rust, or absorb flavors or odors, providing years of use. Dishwasher safe. EXTRA-FINE HOLES FOR EVEN THE SMALLEST TEA LEAVES. With its extra-fine mesh, this infuser precision-brews every variety of tea from large to very small leaves, while the large capacity allows leaves to expand completely for full, delicious flavor. May also be used with teabags. MULTI-FUNCTIONAL LID DOUBLES AS A COASTER. Stainless steel lid helps keep your tea hot during brewing. When you’re finished, simply set the infuser on the lid to catch drips. PROFESSIONAL TEAWARE MANUFACTURER. Teabloom produces only high-quality tea products. Worry-free 1-YEAR GUARANTEE and 24/7 customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t4My1NKJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Teabloom","source_asin":"B0893Q2K45","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-210256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0893Q2K45","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0893Q2K45","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
