window.products.push({"id":210286,"name":"JAXPETY 1050W Handheld Pressurized Steam Cleaner with 9-Piece Accessory Set, Multifunctional Steam Cleaning for Car, Home, Bedroom, Yellow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xw9WyW0UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description: Are you tired with doing cleaning? Do you feel disturbing by grease or stains? JAXPETY Multifunctional Steam Cleaner here comes to help you! Relying on hot pressurized steam, our steam cleaner is good at cleaning up grease, dust, grime and stains that is totally safe without any chemicals. With 9-piece accessories, our steam cleaner is best for cleaning kitchen, toilet, bedroom, fabric clothing, windows, door and fabric clothing. Mini-sized and lightweight design is easy for carry and storage. Besides, safety lock and cap are equipped to protect you from being hurt. Do not hesitate and take it home now! Specification: Color: Yellow Material: PP+Aluminum Alloy Net Weight: 3.3 LBS Overall Dimension: 19.7”(L) x 18.9”(W) x 10.6”(H) Water Capacity: 350 ML Input Voltage: 110-120V, 60HZ Power: 900-1050W Package Includes: 1 x Steam Cleaner 1 x Extended Nozzle 1 x Brush Head 1 x Bent Spray Nozzle 1 x Funnel 1 x Measuring Cup 1 x Window & Door Squeegee 1 x Towel Sleeve 1 x Fabric Steam Tool 1 x Long Spray Nozzle","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xw9WyW0UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JAXPETY","source_asin":"B0772D8G1L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-210286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0772D8G1L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0772D8G1L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":210287,"name":"Dreamair 80th Birthday Gift: Signing Plate(rd)(Box)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":51.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mXXuFPNLL._AC_.jpg","description":"A signing plate hand painted in the UK complete with a baking pen and two plate stands one for use on the wall or a free standing one.We like to think our SignedandSealed Signature Plates are customizable gifts that can be used or admired daily. Family and friends write messages on the Signature Plate with the special pen provided after 24hrs the Signature Plate is baked in the oven at 300°F at home for less than an hour and there you have a fully washable permanent reminder of your special day.SIGNING THE PLATE Take the top off the pen press the nib on a hard surface when youl see the black color come thru the white nib, then you're ready to go. SEALING THE PLATE After 24hrs,put the plate cold into an oven put the temperature to 300°F, when the temperature has been reached (usually 15 minutes or less) bake for a further 40 minutes, switch off oven, open the door and let it cool naturally there you have a washable (by hand) beautiful memento. FAQ's How careful do I need to be when writing on the plate?No need to be too careful, the signatures are usually touch dry within 15 seconds and you can wipe your finger across and they won't smear. Will I have enough room? There is plenty of room on the plate (a lot of guests write their messages as couples) plus you can write on the back of the plate. Can I alter any comments/signatures? You can alter before sealing if you need to. Use a cotton bud with methylated spirit or liquid detergent on and carefully delete the comment/signature. Can I add any signatures after baking? Yes just add signatures wait 24 hrs and bake again.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mXXuFPNLL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dreamair","source_asin":"B00BJ4SJH2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-210287","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BJ4SJH2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BJ4SJH2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
