window.products.push({"id":210306,"name":"RAE DUNN by DesignStyles Spinning Coffee Cup/Mug Display Holder - White - Coffee, Anyone?","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WVCqpAh+S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What a nice addition to your RAE DUNN home collection! Not only is this coffee rack functional, but it makes a great way to display your favorite mugs. It holds 6 mugs on a sturdy metal hooks & wood frame. The message on the bottom says COFFEE, ANYONE in the distinct Rae Dunn font. A native of California Rae Dunn is one of the most influential designers of our time. She has a Bachelor of Arts Degree in Industrial Design and has worked in graphics and fashion design. Her passion is currently working with clay. Rae Dunn’s inspiration comes from nature itself and is very much influenced by the Japanese principle of Wabi–Sabi, which is an appreciation for the aesthetic beauty of the imperfect and impermanence of things. A person who studies Wabi-Sabi finds the most basic natural items interesting, beautiful, and inspiring. Because of Rae Dunn’s desire to create something which has meaning for her, and inspire joy for others, Rae Dunn’s ceramic/pottery creations our sought after far and wide and has become extremely popular with decorators all over the country. As you are probably aware, there is a trend for some to acquire as many Rae Dunn items and they possibly can find. In fact, there is a term that is used for seeking and searching Rae Dunn items…..its called Dunning and those that go on these quest are called Dunners. At the end of the day, with all of the complexities of life and the complications of this world, people just want simple, and yet beautiful items which and be used to have in their homes and to give as gifts to their loved ones and friends. Her creations our sought after far and wide due their amazing quality and beautiful artistic designs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WVCqpAh+S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rae Dunn by DesignStyles","source_asin":"B09893ZH1C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-210306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09893ZH1C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09893ZH1C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
