window.products.push({"id":210326,"name":"UPP Rolling Fruit Collector | Picks up All Sorts of Fruits, Nuts and Balls with Ease| Gather Windfall Without Bending Over (Large (1,6 gal), Anthracit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kesn7spEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy application - the basket collects fruits automatically!  ✅ IT DOES NOT GET ANY EASIER: Every gardener knows the problem: Hundreds of ripe fruits and nuts have fallen from the trees and are scattered across the lawn. Much too precious to let them go to waste but almost impossible to pick up. This dilemma has now been solved thanks to the UPP rolling collector! It could not be simpler: Just roll the basket over any sort of fruit, nut or ball and it gets picked up automatically. Just like that!  ✅ HIGHLY EFFECTIVE: No matter how big the area, no matter how much windfall there is, with our collector you gather up everything from the ground in no time. All without ever bending down. Working comfortably and ergonomically while standing up. ✅ UNIVERSAL: Our roll-up grabber does not just reliably pick up apples, cherries and nuts. You can also gather all kinds of golf balls, putter balls and tennis balls. Everything with a ∅ of 3 to 10 cm fits in the basket. This makes our rolling basket an indispensable gardening tool!  ✅ EASY TO EMPTY: Once collected the fruits stays locked in the roll cage, no matter how much you shake it. Because of that the rolling collector already comes with a special EASY EMPTY add-on. So you can transfer your harvest trouble free.  ✅ QUALITY: The strong construction is made of quality plastics (AP + GF/ABS) and will assist you on many harvests to come. The rolling collector fits every commercial handle with a ∅ of 0,86 inch (🚫 HANDLE NOT INCLUDED).  📋 Dim.: 23,8 x 28 x 16 cm | Vol: 2,2 L | Max. load: 1,2 kg","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kesn7spEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UPP","source_asin":"B07764YJ2F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-210326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07764YJ2F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07764YJ2F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
