window.products.push({"id":210328,"name":"La Cafetiere Rainbow Polka Dot 8-Cup Coffee Press and 2 Mugs Gift Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31py40-wC4L._AC_.jpg","description":"Welcome to La Cafetiere, the real hot drinks experts. Our classic Cafetiere, which is now in its 40th year, was the original plunger-type coffee maker to be marketed in the UK. This award-winning product is now widely recognised as a Design Icon by houseware specialists worldwide and, of course, remains a favorite with customers to this day. As a consequence, the La Cafetiere brand has become synonymous with both design classic and its reputation for quality and innovation. The last few years have seen La Cafetiere develop further this enviable reputation by widening our availablity to the market place. Historically there has been a special emphasis on coffee; however, we have identified trends that have led us into the resurgent market for tea and even more recently into the growing the drinking chocolate sector, through the development of our La Chocolatiere range of products. La Cafetiere continues to work closely with professional partners in all areas. This has allowed La Cafetiere to expand on its familiar range of coffee makers and into the complete hot drinks story.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31py40-wC4L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"La Cafetiere","source_asin":"B000TZUNZS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-210328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000TZUNZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000TZUNZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":210329,"name":"Zombie Infection Birthday Invitations, 20 5\"x7\" Fill In Cards with Twenty White Envelopes by AmandaCreation","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fs+16T6TL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"*** Bigger... Better... and Best of All... Cuter. Presenting Zombie Birthday Party Invitations Designed by a Mom for Moms. Set of 20 Fill-In Postcards (5\"x7\" Each) Comes with 20 White Envelopes *** *2-sided printing for that added pop of color & extra touch of quality *Larger 5\"x7\" size for bigger visual impact (most others are only 4\"x5.5\") *Heftier 80# cardstock with a smooth matte finish (so it's easier to write on) Even Includes Custom-Size Envelopes Hunting for just the right envelopes? Rest easy. Your 20 birthday postcards come with 20 crisp white envelopes, perfectly sized to fit the cards perfectly. What's more, you can count on these eye-popping invites for all-American craftsmanship: They're designed, printed & carefully hand-packaged right here in the USA. To top it off, the complete set is fully backed by Amazon's 30-Day Guarantee. OMG, They're the Absolute Cutest... So Add to Cart Right Away!! Why choose Invitations from Amanda Creation? *Every invitation is custom designed by Amanda herself! *Amanda Creation has been in business since 2011 bringing unique party items to moms and children. *Our invitations are completely unique, you won’t find designs like these anywhere else. Stand out with your celebrations and get the most creative and innovative invitations instead of mass produced invitations that can be found anywhere. *We pay attention to the smallest details, because they are hand designed complete care is taken in making them extra special to be the most beautiful invitations you have ordered.  *We stand behind our product, if you are not completely satisfied for any reason simply contact us to return your product for a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fs+16T6TL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amanda Creation","source_asin":"B01K7SEPQY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-210329","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01K7SEPQY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01K7SEPQY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":210330,"name":"Extremus Temps Travel Mug Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Coffee Tumbler, Upgraded 100% Leakproof Water Bottle Lid And Easy-to-sip Coffee Lid, Coffee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vJ6TUTnBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍵THE ONLY LEAKPROOF TUMBLER – The 100% lead proof is designed to handle coffee and other hot beverages and prevent accidental spills.Two lids included: The main 100% Leakproof sports lid can avoid the annoying spills or accidental knock-overs. And with the chug-style cap, the sports leakproof lid works perfect for any extreme outdoor activities.We have also included a bonus screw on sipping lid for both hot and cold beverages. 🍶TRIPLE-INSULATED COFFEE MUG–The Extremus 20oz/30oz Stainless Steel Tumbler has a 3mm vacuum space, sealed by double walls of 304 stainless steel with a layer of copper coating to isolate hot or cold beverages from the outer surface. This superior triple-insulated design helps to preserve hot beverages up to 12 hours or cold up to 24 hours. 🍸TOP SAFTY INSURANCE TRAVEL MUG– The coffee mugs is constructed with two walls of 18/8 food grade stainless steel to ensure pure taste and no flavor transfer. Both lids are molded with BPA-free materials. A perfect insulated coffee mug to use as travel coffee mug or water bottle. 🍹DISHWASHER SAFE – The Extremus Insulated Tumbler is easy to keep clean by hand, and it’s also dishwasher safe. Be sure to wash the stainless-steel tumbler before initial use. Remove gasket and seals from the lid and hand wash with a mild dish soap and warm water for a thorough cleaning. 🥤BEST VALUE INSULATED TUMBLERS- The super tough DuraPowder Coat on the colored Extremus Tumblers add additional grip and won’t crack, peel or fade. It’s totally no-sweat and burn-free. Great as a coffee travel mug for men or coffee tumbler for women on the go.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vJ6TUTnBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Extremus","source_asin":"B09BVX6VV7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-210330","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BVX6VV7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BVX6VV7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":210331,"name":"Fun Express Metal Wedding Bell on A Paper Card | 50 Count","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XbU-WLkjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WEDDING BELLS - Each paper card is printed with a lovely poem and has a beautiful attached metal bell that guests can ring to wish the happy couple lifelong bliss. WEDDING PLACE CARDS - Set a place card next to each place setting at your wedding reception or hand them out after the ceremony. PACK INCLUSION - Includes 50 paper cards, each measuring 3.5-inches. The perfect amount for small to medium-sized weddings! PARTY ESSENTIALS - Fun Express offers a variety of partyware, including dinnerware, treats, favors, decorations, and more! Be sure to browse our collection! CHOKING HAZARD - Warning: Small parts. Not for children under three years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XbU-WLkjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fun Express","source_asin":"B0056Z80S8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-210331","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0056Z80S8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0056Z80S8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
