window.products.push({"id":210517,"name":"Max & Lily Classic 3-Drawer Wood Dresser, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uVO4Rb9wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Max & Lily Classic 3-Drawer Wood Dresser provides space to organize while completing your bedroom in contemporary style. The knot-free, solid wood dresser frame and drawer fronts create an extra strong and sturdy design. The engineered wood dresser backing and dresser drawer bottoms provide superior stability and durability. Crafted with non-toxic, low VOC finishes, this wood dresser is ideal for your clean and healthy home. This kids dresser comes in six color finishes to complement the design and décor of your bedroom furniture and coordinating bedroom sets. Three roomy drawers provide ample clothes storage with the interior of each drawer measuring 33” L x 13” W x 6” H. This dresser for kids bedroom includes wood drawer glides to make each clothes drawer easy to open without the use of additional hardware. The assembled storage dresser measures 37.25” L x 15.75” W x 33” H. The provided anti-tip kit must be attached to the wall per the assembly instructions. This wooden dresser is an ideal size that will grow with your child. Pair this dresser for bedroom with your Max & Lily bunk bed, loft bed, single bed, and other kids bedroom furniture for the perfect matching look. This chest of drawers ships flat packed in one box. Some assembly is required. Includes easy-to-read instructions and all the tools you need for a quick setup. The Classic 3-Drawer Wood Dresser from Max & Lily offers exceptional quality and affordability that kids and their parents will enjoy for years to come. Max & Lily is a member of the Maxwood family of brands – the kids furniture experts bringing a tradition of superior quality, safety and fun! \"WARNING: Furniture tipover can result in serious injury or death. This dresser includes tipover-prevention hardware that MUST BE ATTACHED TO THE WALL per the assembly instructions. Its counter-weighted design enhances the stability of the dresser and reduces the risk of furniture tipover. This dresser has been tested and complies with the ASTM F2057 anti-tip standard. To reduce the risk of furniture tipover: • ALWAYS install tipover restraint provided • NEVER put a TV on this product • NEVER allow children to stand, climb or hang on drawers, doors or shelves • NEVER open more than one drawer at a time • Place heaviest items in the lowest drawers Should you need another anti-tip kit, please contact our Customer Service Team for a free replacement.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uVO4Rb9wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Max & Lily","source_asin":"B0B2KK2FNN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-210517","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2KK2FNN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2KK2FNN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
