window.products.push({"id":210528,"name":"Panda Canvas Tote Bag for Women, Reusable Bag with Zipper, Shopping Bag, Beach Bag, Travel Bag, Printed Cotton Cute Bag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+hfG+ErLL._AC_UL1328_.jpg","description":"The Story of The Designs: If you've ever watched video of panda, you'll certainly noticed that they're much more lovely than those pattern designs of them.  They're stereotyped, black ears, black eyes, eating bamboo.etc. Actually, each has its own features. Our designs are based on real pandas, like Mei Lan, Ji Xiao, Hao Yue. Their names are also printed on corresponding bags. Mei Lan , the model of the orange bag. She is famous for her dietary preference.  As known, panda eats bamboo, but she loves pumpkin very much, that's why I drew a pumpkin. Ji Xiao , the model of the contrast color bag. She was gray and white in color, rather than black and white before she was half a year old.  She has special color, so I drew several colors as background. Hao Yue , the model of the khaki bag. He is the most beautiful panda, which is recognized by all.  His favorite toy is a bear doll, so I drew it on this design. And, by the way, he is the boyfriend of Ji Xiao. The green bag is the only one without a certain panda as model. It's a toy car in panda kindergarten of Chengdu Base.  If you have time to visit, you'll see that many baby pandas fight for this toy car. As a merchant, maybe it's not a good choice to write these. I should have listed the material, use occasion or target audience. But I really want to share something special about pandas with you.  In package, a postcard and a pin will be sent together with the bag as free gifts. They're also original designs. Trust me, it's a wonderful choice for panda lovers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+hfG+ErLL._AC_UL1328_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"common","source_asin":"B08CK5C9W4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-210528","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CK5C9W4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CK5C9W4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
