window.products.push({"id":210724,"name":"Smoke Eraser V5 | Personal Air Purifier Filter with 1000+ Uses | Eliminates Odor & Protects from 2nd Hand Smoke Buddy Roommate Family etc. | 4x Lifesp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qTlSPTUgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"300 Uses Is Premature Failure: Why does every other brand personal air filter share the same stated lifespan of just 300 exhales? Because that's how long it takes for unchecked breath moisture to soak and ruin a HEPA filter Smaller And Exponentially Longer Lasting, How? Short answer, moisture management. Breath moisture is half liquid, half gas (water vapor). A patent pending prefilter blocks the liquid, and a less absorbent, customized HEPA filter is dried of the passing gaseous portion via removable lid between sessions Protection & Peace Of Mind: Protect loved ones from secondhand smoke. Buddy to roommate, spouse to children. Those who must share air with a smoker can gift (to self) this hand-held eraser for healthier environment. Or suppress ones own secondhand smoke. Trap smoke, show respect How To Maximize Smoke Eraser Lifespan & Value: Heavy smokers or anyone wishing to multiply lifespan should rotate 2 units and/or add a Docking Station (aka: Lifespan Multiplier). Either will multiply output, both together will do so exponentially What Is The Docking Station? Our latest release just recently made available. A product bought just once that multiplies life to every unit you'll ever buy again, whether Smoke Eraser or Smoke Buddy. Yes, the unit was made to also fit the Smoke Buddy Original","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qTlSPTUgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SMOKE ERASER","source_asin":"B0C3XSFZ2K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-210724","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3XSFZ2K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3XSFZ2K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
