window.products.push({"id":210732,"name":"Convenience Concepts Designs2Go Trestle Desk with Shelves, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":104.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sHiu4fXXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking to spruce up your workspace? The Designs2Go Trestle Desk with Shelves by Convenience Concepts is the solution! This desk has no age limit with its contemporary design and combines simplicity and functionality all in one. Thanks to the large surface top, there is ample space for a student who is studying or for those working from home. The left side of this desk features two sturdy shelves giving additional space to store schoolwork or office essentials. Built to last, this unit was crafted from Particleboard and MDF. The Designs2Go Trestle Desk is available in a wide variety of bold colors that are sure to match with any current furnishings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sHiu4fXXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Convenience Concepts","source_asin":"B09412RKP8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-210732","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09412RKP8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09412RKP8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
