window.products.push({"id":210763,"name":"OSK Japanese Traditional Rabbit Moon Bento Box Set, Includes 620ml 2-Tier Bento Box, Chopsticks, Bento Bag, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510tBvzirtL._AC_.jpg","description":"This Bento imported and made in Japan by OSK, is usually sold to Japanese people, who really know what to expect from a good Bento. - This Bento is made for real day to day use. It's big enough for a complete (slim fit or portion control) meal. - Tsuki Hana means moon and flowers. It's a traditional pattern. On the upper part, we can see a cute white rabbit, looking at the moon, apparently completely absorbed in contemplation. - The Tsuki Hana Japanese Bento is composed of - first large compartment with divider and chopstick cover - second compartment with cover - the upper side cover (with the cute rabbit moon pattern) - a pair of sticks - a super cute protection bag with the same rabbit moon pattern - an elastic strap to shut the Bento. - hand wash recommended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510tBvzirtL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OSK","source_asin":"B003VM8P8S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-210763","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003VM8P8S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003VM8P8S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
