window.products.push({"id":210841,"name":"Mason Jar Vacuum Sealer, EBGRF Electric Jar Sealer and Accessory Hose Compatible with FoodSaver Vacuum Sealer, Vacuum Sealing Kit for Wide & Regular M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ou5ne4j-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Complete Vacuum Sealer Kit】1* wide mouth sealer, 1*regular mouth sealer, 1*Electric Vacuum Pump (for electric pumping), 1* Lid Opener (for easy opening of mason jar lids), 1*USB cable, 4* wide mouth mason jar lids (86 mm) and 4* regular mouth mason jar lids (70 mm), 2* Hose Connecter,2* Reusable Food Storage Bags,1* Sealing Clips. 【Electric Portable Vacuum Pump】Our vacuum sealer with jar attachment is equipped with a electric vacuum pump. No more manual vacuum pump. You can use a electric pump, which will pump out the air in the mason jar. And the handheld vacuum sealer is very easy to carry when traveling or having a picnic! It will be your portable and more affordable choice of vacuum sealer. 【Easy to Use 】The food vacuum sealer with jar sealer kit fits wide-mouth and regular-mouth mason jars (excluding mason jars). Making sure the electric vacuum pump is centered and pressed firmly over the lid of the canister, align the interface and start the vacuum pump for about 6-10s, the air can be exhausted to the sealing state. Food saver jar sealer attachment are easy to clean, washable, and dishwasher safe. 【Multifunctional Use】Our electric vacuum pump not only works with mason jar vacuum sealer kits, but also with reusable gallon vacuum zipper bags. Connected to the vacuum zipper bag valve to exhaust the air in the bag to a sealed state. And the accessory hose can be used compatible with FoodSaver vacuum sealer port. Connecting with the accessory hose to extract the air from inside the jar, pumping it out through the hose to form an air-tight seal. 【Keep Food Fresh】With the help of mason jar vacuum sealer kit, you can quickly and easily remove air from mason jars to create a vacuum seal, which keeps food fresh for longer and prevents food from getting spoiled and wet. Canning jar vacuum sealers are ideal for safely storing food such as jam, pickles, nuts, salads, dried fruit, coffee, grains, seeds, herbs, sauces, mustard, honey, sugar, flour, pasta and more. Keep your food as fresh as the first day after a week of storage! 【Only Compatible With FoodSaver】:EBGRF food grade silicone pumping hose can only be used compatible with FoodSaver vacuum sealer machine. (Note: Not compatible with these models of FoodSaver:FM2000,FM2100,FM2500,FM4800,FM4900,FM580,V50160,VS1130,VS0100,VS0150,US220,FM1100 【100% Satisfaction】: Please read the user manual before use. If you have any dissatisfaction or suggestions about our mason jar vacuum sealer or services, please contact us immediately, we will provide you with satisfactory service within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ou5ne4j-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EBGRF","source_asin":"B0BBFZDCD3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-210841","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBFZDCD3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBFZDCD3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
