window.products.push({"id":210906,"name":"Wisdomen Clear Rectangle Polycarbonate Chocolate Mold,PC Mould Pastry Jelly& Candy Baking Tools","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QaS+OssQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Feature: Material:PC(Polycarbonate) Color: Transparent Type:48-Rectangle External mold size: Approx.27.5cm x 17.5cm x 2.5cm Internal mold size: Approx.3.4cm x 1.5cm x 1cm Package include: 1 x clear chocolate mold(Item packaged in a box) How to use: 1, Melting chocolate in the 50-60 ℃ water separated from the heating water,Melting process, pay attention to three points: - can't let the chocolate touch the water; - keep stirring in the same direction all the time; - after the end of the mold, you should gently shake the mold, so that the chocolate evenly distributed in the Chocolate Mold inside. 2, Back into the PC mold after the cold for about 5 minutes, and then wrap it, put into the refrigerator after 15-30 minutes then take out. 3, Gently knock on the back of the mold to each chocolate. Chocolate will automatically release and out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QaS+OssQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wisdomen","source_asin":"B071YYW8B3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-210906","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071YYW8B3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071YYW8B3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
