window.products.push({"id":210945,"name":"Home-Ever Natural Edge Side Table, Live Edge End Table with 3 Hairpin Legs, Nightstand Plant Stand for Bedroom and Living Room(19\" L x 16\" W x 20\" H)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Lh74WsoJL._AC_SL1228_.jpg","description":"Description: HOME-EVER specializes in natural wood products that are unique in many ways. This Live Edge Side Table is made of 100% solid cedar wood slab sourced from sustainable tree roots. Every piece of wood is carefully selected and carved into natural shapes by our skilled wood makers. This side table is not only a gorgeous piece of woodwork but is carefully constructed for practical uses such as a side table, nightstand, plant stand, and display stand. Also ideal as a gift for your friends and family, or housewarming party.Product Features: The top surface is wear- resistant and the hairpin legs are sturdy. Contrasting colors of reddish brown streaks and spots. Beautiful and natural wood grains, knots, and burls. Every wood slab is unique and varies by growth rings, textures, and patterns. Can be using as a side table, end table, accent table, night stand, plant stand for living room, bedroom and entryway. The color and shape varies from piece to piece, making each of our tables unique and add a playful vintage look to the furniture.Product Specifications: Top Material: Cedar Wood Base Material: Metal Top Color: Reddish Brown Base Color: Black Weight Capacity: 190 pounds Product Weight: 8.7 pounds Product Size(Average): 19\"L x 16\"W x 20\"T (48 x 40.5 x 51cm) Table Top Size: 1.5\" thickLove Tips: This table comes with a layer of clear coat. Cleaning is as simple as dusting the surface occasionally. However, due to its softness, cedar wood dents and scratches easily. We recommend applying sealer regularly to retain its color and stability. Package Included: 1* wood slab 3* hairpin legs 12* self-tapping screws Warranty: 12 months","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Lh74WsoJL._AC_SL1228_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BCPRCPZK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-210945","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCPRCPZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCPRCPZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
