window.products.push({"id":210971,"name":"Stainless Steel Vegetable Steamer Basket for Cooking, Food Steamer Basket with Removable Center Handle for Veggie Seafood Cooking, mobzio Folding Expa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j2XL3-LwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multi-Function: In addition to cooking, the steamer can also be used as a strainer or fruit tray. You can also use it to filter extra water when making salads.From busy moms to college students to culinary artists,this product is absolutely essential for people who want to get more health from their diet.It comes in a box of the right size,which is ideal for your family and friends. Healthier Cooking Choices: The premium steamer rack is designed with high-quality stainless steel petals, plastic handles and silicone feet to ensure your health.Steaming is a healthy cooking choice because it can better retain the nutrients,vitamins,and minerals in the food during cooking.The foldable steamer can be used to steam vegetables,seafood,eggs,meat,desserts,and more. Extendable Handle & Foldable Legs: Vegetable steamer basket extendable plastic handle helps easy insertion to the pots and removal from the boiling water.Three foldable silicone legs to keep food above boiling water and won't scratch your pot. Easy to Clean & Store: You can clean the steamer basket very easily.When You are ready to put away,then fold in to its original half size.It comes in a perfect sized box makes it an awesome gift for your family or friends. Superior Construction: Thoughtfully designed with a removable and adjustable center post that makes the insertion effortless even with deep pots.If you need more space in the steamer for larger foods,the handle can be easily unscrewed for an extra room.These three foldable feet have a silicone attachment that won’t scratch or damage your cookware.Note: The use of fork,spoon,or tong is recommended to prevent you from burning your fingers when removing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j2XL3-LwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"mobzio","source_asin":"B096FHCJND","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-210971","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096FHCJND","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096FHCJND","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":210972,"name":"NOVICA Blue Zapotec Cotton Bedspread Quilt, Oaxaca Ocean' (King)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91d9EzX2jHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer. About this item: For this bedspread, Carmen Ruiz uses natural dyes to capture the cool blue of the Pacific Ocean that bathes Oaxaca's coasts. Working on a traditional pedal loom, she adorns the cotton bedspread with Zapotec motifs in beige and hand-knotted tassels on the border. - All natural dyes - Dry clean only - Hand-crafted item -- color, size and/or motif may vary slightly About our Artist: 'Born in the weaving village of Teotitlan del Valle, I specialize in creating accessories on the traditional loom. My parents taught me how to weave when I was 15 years old, and the first piece I worked on was a rebozo shawl, which I gave to my mom as a Mother's Day gift,' Carmen Ruiz recounts. 'I've been weaving since the 1980's, and in 2002 I started my own workshop where I specialize in shawls and bedspreads. The most challenging aspect of starting on my own was having a place where I could exhibit my creations.'","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91d9EzX2jHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B01MA6IRJP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-210972","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MA6IRJP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MA6IRJP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
